<figure data-recovery class="recovery" aria-labelledby="r37-history-title">
 <p class="figure-title" id="r37-history-title">Figure 1 · Keep the booking, remove the mistake</p>
 <p class="note">Conceptual alternative class history. 11:00 and 11:05 are scenario labels, not captured commit times.</p>
 <div class="history"><div>Saved base<br/><strong>S503 · 3 places</strong></div><div class="mistake">11:00 · mistake<br/><strong>Capacity becomes 30</strong></div><div>11:05 · Edda<br/><strong>B203 accepted</strong></div><div class="fence">Close old writer<br/><strong>No new admissions</strong></div></div>
 <div class="branch" data-live data-stage>Candidate: not yet restored</div>
 <dl class="state"><div><dt>Capacity</dt><dd data-live data-capacity>—</dd></div><div><dt>Remaining</dt><dd data-live data-remaining>—</dd></div><div><dt>B203 copies</dt><dd data-live data-bookings>—</dd></div></dl>
 <p data-explanation data-live aria-live="polite">The source contains a bad capacity change and a later valid booking. Preserve both histories while preparing an isolated candidate.</p>
 <div class="controls" role="group" aria-label="Restore and reconciliation playback"><button data-play>Play</button><button data-back>Back</button><button data-next>Next</button><button data-reset>Reset</button><span data-step></span></div><div data-hold aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>
 <figcaption>Recovery goes back before the mistake, so it also removes B203. Reconciliation brings back the booking and its decrement of remaining capacity together. The old writer stays fenced throughout acceptance. The illustrated second attempt reuses the same request identity.</figcaption>
 <details><summary>Read the history as text</summary><ol><li>The saved base has capacity and remaining capacity 3.</li><li>The mistake changes capacity to 30, leaving remaining capacity 3; B203 then consumes one place, leaving 2.</li><li>Fence all old writers, settle in-flight requests and enumerate the closed history.</li><li>Restore before the mistake: capacity 3, remaining 3, no B203.</li><li>Reconcile B203 and its decrement in one transaction: remaining 2.</li><li>Repeat the same identity and payload: one booking, remaining 2.</li><li>Only after data and external-effect acceptance may the candidate receive write authority.</li></ol></details>
</figure>
<style>.recovery{margin:2rem 0;padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--color-rule-strong);background:var(--color-surface-alt);font:.9rem/1.55 var(--font-sans)}.recovery .figure-title{margin:0 0 1rem;font-size:1.1rem}.note,figcaption{color:var(--color-text-secondary);font-size:.85rem}.history{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:.4rem}.history>div{padding:.65rem;border:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary)}.history .mistake{border-style:dashed}.history .fence{border:2px solid var(--color-accent)}.branch{margin:1rem 0;border-left:3px solid var(--color-accent);padding:.7rem}.state{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:.4rem;margin:1rem 0}.state>div{padding:.5rem;border:1px solid var(--color-rule-strong)}dt{font-size:.8rem}dd{margin:0;font-size:1.4rem}.controls{display:flex;gap:.4rem;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;margin:1rem 0}.controls button{font:inherit;background:var(--color-surface);color:var(--color-text);border:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary);padding:.45rem .65rem;cursor:pointer;border-radius:.2rem}.controls button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-accent);outline-offset:3px}.controls button[aria-disabled=true]{opacity:.55}[data-hold]{height:3px;background:var(--color-rule)}[data-hold] span{display:block;width:0;height:100%;background:var(--color-accent)}figcaption{margin:1rem 0}details ol{padding-left:1.3rem;margin-top:.8rem}@media(max-width:600px){.history{grid-template-columns:1fr}.history>div+div:before{content:'↓ ';color:var(--color-accent)}}
</style>
<script>
import {stepper} from '../../figures/stepper.mjs';
for(const root of document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-recovery]')){
 const states=[['Candidate: not yet restored','—','—','—','The source contains a bad capacity change and a later valid booking. Preserve both histories while preparing an isolated candidate.'],['Old writer fenced; source history closed','—','—','—','The fence waits for admitted work and rejects the request racing behind it. Enumerating accepted identities now finds booking-edda-B203.'],['Recovery stopped before the mistake','3','3','0','The bad capacity change is excluded. So is later valid B203. A working candidate at this point is missing an accepted booking.'],['B203 reconciled atomically','3','2','1','One transaction records B203 for Edda, decrements remaining capacity and remembers its stable request identity.'],['Same request replayed','3','2','1','The matching identity and payload find the existing outcome. No second booking or capacity decrement occurs.'],['Candidate accepted; authority may transfer','3','2','1','Check the closed source history and any separate external effects. The old writer remains fenced; only the accepted candidate may receive new traffic.']];
 stepper(root,{steps:()=>states.length,draw:(n:number)=>{const s=states[n];for(const [i,sel] of ['[data-stage]','[data-capacity]','[data-remaining]','[data-bookings]','[data-explanation]'].entries())root.querySelector(sel)!.textContent=s[i];}});
}
</script>
